# Tomik's static ability is granted to each planeswalker its controller controls, so a planeswalker that has lost all
# its abilities no longer has the cap (CR 613.1f). Bot2 controls both Tomik and Wrenn and Six; Bot1's Flourishing
# Grapple strips Wrenn of all abilities until end of turn, and two creatures may now attack Wrenn in one declaration -
# T5 shows the same declaration refused once the ability is back. The bite is dealt by Ornithopter, power 0, so Wrenn
# takes only the Changeling's 2 on this turn (3 loyalty to 1) and the other 2 when the ability has returned (dead).

